    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know if \"different help\" would change anything. it's just me. it's just my existence that's the problem. i keep thinking that if i wasn't even here, they could finally breathe. they could have their lives back. wouldn't it actually be more compassionate to just... let them be free of me? instead of me just dragging them down forever?",
